ImageOptim by Kornel Lesiński and contributors is a GUI for 3rd party utilities:
OxiPNG by Josh Holmer,
pngquant by Kornel Lesiński,
PNGCrush by Glenn Randers-Pehrson,
MozJPEG by Mozilla and contributors,
Guetzli, Zopfli by Jyrki Alakuijala, Lode Vandevenne,
AdvPNG by Andrea Mazzoleni, Filipe Estima,
Jpegoptim by Timo Kokkonen,
Gifsicle by Eddie Kohler,
SVGO by Kir Belevich,
svgcleaner by Evgeniy Reizner,
